==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|halb|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*halbaz}}. Compare Dutch {{term|half|lang=nl}}, English {{term|half|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|halv|lang=da}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|De-halb.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Adjective===
{{de-adj|-}}

# [[half]], [[halfway]]
#: Er ist seit einem '''halben''' Monat nicht mehr hier gewesen.
#:: He hasn't been here for half a month.

====Declension====
{{de-decl-adj-notcomp|halb}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|de|Halbkugel}}
* {{l|de|halbieren}}
* {{l|de|Halbblut}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|de|Hälfte}}

===Preposition===
{{de-prep}}

# a [[half-hour]] before, thirty minutes before {{i|used with the number of the following hour}}
#: {{ux|de|Wir treffen uns um '''halb''' zwei.|We’re meeting at one-thirty.}}

====See also====
* {{l|de|dreiviertel}}
* {{l|de|viertel}}

